{"media_id": 3782894528232420387, "shortcode": "DR_iofiD_Qj", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR_iofiD_Qj/", "taken_at": "2025-12-08T06:47:34", "caption": "笑容逐漸消失…\n#studyinuk #fyp #lifeisbeautiful", "owner_username": "coco_wong_chinyui", "owner_id": "1457375855", "likes": 8502, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0001_DR_iofiD_Qj\\DR_iofiD_Qj_20251208_064734.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "17921725956208315", "text": "是要變做灰姑娘嗎？", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:22:51", "owner": "agem_mchc", "likes": 42}, {"id": "18099711106794305", "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:41:57", "owner": "ktlee_188", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17903274516321602", "text": "所以呢, UK係去嚟訓練獨立🙂‍↕️🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:18:05", "owner": "m40cl_", "likes": 3}, {"id": "18087398521825958", "text": "넌 이미 예쁘다. ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:05:11", "owner": "lvan_yum", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18104209939661567", "text": "白滑😍", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:15:30", "owner": "joegalahadchurchill2", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17843402355654427", "text": "講到我please del", "created_at": "2025-12-16T17:52:50", "owner": "t0_ja1", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18105326050732955", "text": "True一定係會學煮飯", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:48:34", "owner": "jackchs_1205", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17975807309954132", "text": "IcomefromChina.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:00:32", "owner": "zba09221797", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18067470401131958", "text": "@agem_mchc @daydayhapidaydaysleep 我預備好食大餐了", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:51:48", "owner": "matthewpwj_", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18116554534569594", "text": "damn you can do everything", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:13:05", "owner": "aslamirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18184818637352792", "text": "變咗識照顧自己長大了", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:24:01", "owner": "panjai238", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18083625035514560", "text": "滾回國", "created_at": "2025-12-17T06:08:21", "owner": "chiaseeds95", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18074593778256456", "text": "歡迎入我既回流group，有意PM我", "created_at": "2025-12-16T05:27:30", "owner": "howardngai", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17859665427558108", "text": "#只要懂得腿張開不愁沒飯沒床沒錢花", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:19:57", "owner": "calvinlicious", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17846577441619071", "text": "@jun0503__ 頂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:21:27", "owner": "guo.coo", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["studyinuk", "fyp", "lifeisbeautiful"]},
{"media_id": 3724046700496374306, "shortcode": "DOueL5GDUoi", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOueL5GDUoi/", "taken_at": "2025-09-18T02:11:06", "caption": "Turn your classic Casio into a smartwatch—without losing that retro soul. Check it out from @olleewatch \n#techgadgets #casio #casiowatch #smartwatch", "owner_username": "retrotechlab", "owner_id": "72523889372", "likes": 183591, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0001_DOueL5GDUoi\\DOueL5GDUoi_20250918_021106.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17918337942178004, "text": "What’s the usual battery life on this?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T12:42:10", "owner": "carlos__bueno", "likes": 2543}, {"id": 18283304332279578, "text": "how does the heart rate monitoring even work through the metal case?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:23:57", "owner": "alex_stava", "likes": 352}, {"id": 18012627389795222, "text": "This is soo cool, but in the cost of chip I can buy 2 more casio still would have some changes left. But still super cool", "created_at": "2025-09-18T05:49:23", "owner": "dev_sm", "likes": 3433}, {"id": 18096913900649347, "text": "What about Doom?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:42:13", "owner": "amir7hz", "likes": 863}, {"id": 18056213843245107, "text": "That is not what a smartwatch is. Can it even display notifications?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T23:46:52", "owner": "_.a_d_a_m._", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18079060201978410, "text": "Wait how are the monitoring heart rate,?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T21:12:11", "owner": "curious24.7", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17937216240077487, "text": "Wow!!! 😍", "created_at": "2025-09-18T03:08:23", "owner": "ardy_putra", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18090157249746942, "text": "Wow! 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:16:24", "owner": "courtzsgd", "likes": 138}, {"id": 18424415137100201, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T00:33:58", "owner": "mracekproductions", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18085212844898992, "text": "Damn that is SOOOO cool 😍", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:26:13", "owner": "camshand.jpg", "likes": 460}, {"id": 18426136048099335, "text": "Awesome 😮", "created_at": "2025-09-19T01:57:51", "owner": "timex.vintagemx", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17855240388532769, "text": "What about Casio royale?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:05:13", "owner": "cap_paolo96", "likes": 387}, {"id": 18309328069216142, "text": "@monsieur_mopo, leider geil… 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:10:20", "owner": "rocknryll", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17873133504431325, "text": "Is it still water resistant?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T18:07:23", "owner": "kimmylatch", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18018511370767850, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-22T11:30:26", "owner": "hannah_insta_hannah", "likes": 96}, {"id": 18054083978226835, "text": "Ummm yes please", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:32:13", "owner": "accidentallywesanderson", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17879225022283649, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-09-18T21:26:04", "owner": "sarakhanov", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18086728966797177, "text": "Чегоооооо?!", "created_at": "2025-11-12T20:00:55", "owner": "bymilka2103v2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112262389532130, "text": "wait, heart rate monitor? how is it tracking my heart when theres no sensor but yeah i get the product, seems great", "created_at": "2025-09-19T04:50:08", "owner": "marosuu_", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18078720443020844, "text": "what does the app cost? And does it sync up with apple health?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:02:54", "owner": "fearxthexd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059409890413785, "text": "I wanna give this a try", "created_at": "2025-09-18T06:17:39", "owner": "bdraid", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18383102683182315, "text": "@darrenmartinoreilly", "created_at": "2025-10-20T22:24:59", "owner": "samhopesocial", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961383939976556, "text": "Just imagine being Casio with almost unlimited resources in comparison, and not having a product like this", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:08:03", "owner": "adinkis", "likes": 334}, {"id": 17889019131224207, "text": "How does the HR works if it doesn’t have a HR sensor?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:20:02", "owner": "starboymar", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075071671890089, "text": "💳💳💳💳💳💳", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:47:23", "owner": "raaed.dwg", "likes": 45}, {"id": 18076602749092485, "text": "Sub zero cool!!", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:02:34", "owner": "budget_audiophiler", "likes": 20}, {"id": 17894207034181829, "text": "Can we get this for Rolex Daytona? It won’t even tell me the date", "created_at": "2025-09-18T21:50:21", "owner": "lb.q2", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18116889943515035, "text": "This is amazing!! Is it compatible with the f91w?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:58:11", "owner": "diridam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113797180534585, "text": "@rikibarker", "created_at": "2025-10-08T05:06:34", "owner": "regio.parrillero", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081273454785478, "text": "How can it measure your heart rate?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T10:49:55", "owner": "stratsmitha", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18026861012559039, "text": "Had me at black Jack", "created_at": "2025-10-31T17:43:48", "owner": "_piercerose", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18129939331411319, "text": "I wont get anything done with blackjack on my wrist", "created_at": "2025-09-18T19:15:51", "owner": "redrups98", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18084633973729736, "text": "Best way to ruin a Casio 👌", "created_at": "2025-09-19T05:33:05", "owner": "jonsimo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116711689539067, "text": "As someone who dislikes the look of smart watches. I would 100% buy this", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:01:31", "owner": "a.aabattery", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18053435918214750, "text": "Heart rate ? Where? The back is metal ??", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:10:30", "owner": "ahmed_zin_n", "likes": 58}, {"id": 18086304088937577, "text": "Again. Kudos to @olleewatch. Pls check out that classic Casio calculator game as I suggested. It's like Tetris with digits.👏", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:01:38", "owner": "chronomancr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065725751112409, "text": "😢🫣🫣🙄🫢🧐🥺🙅", "created_at": "2025-11-14T10:35:00", "owner": "unicorn.997189", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089927947658127, "text": "Does this work on the A168 model? It's just like the a158 but with a different illuminator", "created_at": "2025-09-28T03:42:25", "owner": "dalton._.lee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17910049728251832, "text": "This comes with mosad spy processor too?", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:53:19", "owner": "tha.b", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17923511319077406, "text": "THIS IS SUPER DUPER COOLIO!", "created_at": "2025-09-18T03:13:22", "owner": "seanaloha", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18155624047389454, "text": "@sharan_._.1", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:13:29", "owner": "nocturnal1894", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921845428138439, "text": "Pashmam", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:21:42", "owner": "mosara.io", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18163328527374265, "text": "Will this fit F91w", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:58:20", "owner": "iikartikii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028525709735073, "text": "@stephen5289", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:41:20", "owner": "paulthomson1984", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080296387810578, "text": "Visto il tuo like provvidenziale @cristianomaretti", "created_at": "2025-09-27T19:38:55", "owner": "wolfmichelis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101653282548095, "text": "@beszeljunkorakrol 👀 érdekes", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:04:34", "owner": "temesi_mark", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18167427040365435, "text": "@bha_bo_ghure @r.i.t.w.i.k", "created_at": "2025-09-23T16:16:15", "owner": "of_the_gridd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291891298259050, "text": "There already is a original Casio watch which can connect to your smartphone for Steps, alarms and even finding your phone… it’s not even expensive :D", "created_at": "2025-09-22T15:56:35", "owner": "clemens.tbi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096944179642212, "text": "Does this work with most Casio watches?", "created_at": "2025-09-21T04:45:49", "owner": "luke_w262", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18092660923741196, "text": "Cc @fborsik", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:20:14", "owner": "tam.hanna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056833205176702, "text": "Any link for purchasing the module?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T05:58:26", "owner": "scaxuk_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17882751195262533, "text": "@hmdtvkli", "created_at": "2025-09-21T06:13:12", "owner": "mashayekh.mhh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052812605554538, "text": "Alguien sabe qué modelo es?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:20:23", "owner": "nick_zamu", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18071176135927055, "text": "@adrianbarker thoughts on this as a daily driver? Would make a cool video", "created_at": "2025-09-19T20:42:48", "owner": "rhys_rs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894588703328245, "text": "Does it have phone notifications?", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:30:58", "owner": "reid.cone", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059760710116618, "text": "That's really cool!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-20T17:30:04", "owner": "sanketbhoiir", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041446214416728, "text": "It's pretty expensive for only being usable for such a short amount of time before the battery runs out. And casios are waterproof. This one isn't anymore. It's not practical like a normal one but still funny", "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:17:43", "owner": "gillian_baits", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18157590349376749, "text": "AND BLACK JACK?!??!!", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:09:17", "owner": "amirhafezbanei", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848339638561663, "text": "Pebble watch did this years ago and it was perfect but Fitbit bought them out", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:51:27", "owner": "b_mcd314", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18126764419481381, "text": "Really great", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:56:58", "owner": "pattydiazromero", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979141827860717, "text": "What? Again back to 80's 😮", "created_at": "2025-09-20T14:07:11", "owner": "vladsidorak", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077542016105765, "text": "This is amazing. Where can I buy it?", "created_at": "2025-09-20T12:59:03", "owner": "tevzk12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071682704117247, "text": "בטוח פיתוח של חרדים 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:41:51", "owner": "itsyosk", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18096505951732755, "text": "It’s not a movement though", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:45:16", "owner": "sergeihammerer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079207021791489, "text": "Hella cool", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:37:00", "owner": "pashya_boi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18337069657206831, "text": "@beszeljunkorakrol", "created_at": "2025-09-19T18:53:49", "owner": "vasko.andras", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061559426457835, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:20:04", "owner": "almutairitech", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17980437860872302, "text": "So this is what it feels like to be oneshotted by an ad. It's like a more user-friendly sensorwatch with more useful features! Getting one.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T13:18:06", "owner": "clindo_niconler", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17876462667310518, "text": "Shut up and take my money", "created_at": "2025-09-19T20:02:42", "owner": "bytomedwards", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919628992168690, "text": "Can you get texts on the screen from your watch?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T20:07:37", "owner": "dankastner", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075879485016118, "text": "Casio fumbled this. They should've done that with a charger and sell that.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:28:53", "owner": "yan_leonardeschi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18091795810692190, "text": "Should've had call and text alerts", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:27:45", "owner": "mujji99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098336185712740, "text": "People buy casios not to have a smartwatch.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:18:37", "owner": "fe_uille", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016605695782366, "text": "Will there be an option for a women's Casio?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T14:43:39", "owner": "plecki_em", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097923775645403, "text": "@mrwhosetheboss can you review this please", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:09:10", "owner": "supasanj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18398441707136416, "text": "Leute, das müsst ihr haben! Ist von dem Sohn eines Freundes erfunden. Funktioniert 1a… Ich bin kein Smartwatch Typ, aber wer ne CASIO hat, sollte das unbedingt ausprobieren. Viel Spaß 😉", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:38:26", "owner": "andrea_borha", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054699050440446, "text": "Just buy another Casio for that money. They are coolest watches without any smart options things", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:01:01", "owner": "bekeevkairzhan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915219643179222, "text": "how do you hr monitor with a solid case back?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:43:10", "owner": "agramofchad", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18284840533286973, "text": "@hhvclothing  you know what to do!! ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:41:10", "owner": "metro.am", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057618389451734, "text": "Will it work on the W86?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:04:37", "owner": "erwin_steffensen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946840975041041, "text": "@captain2phones bro", "created_at": "2025-09-19T02:51:59", "owner": "isaacramirez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095941099581649, "text": "Im not rich pls algorithm stop showing me these things...", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:18:53", "owner": "peter_h4ck3d", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17945870718024823, "text": "Wow, now we just need notifications and I will shift in a heartbeat 😬", "created_at": "2025-09-18T15:46:23", "owner": "casper_vn", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18081619612760615, "text": "What Casio is this?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T21:32:04", "owner": "lennartoest", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870735985353695, "text": "@_lifewithrishabh_", "created_at": "2025-09-18T19:04:16", "owner": "dravishchawla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075729110107126, "text": "@n.jorhel", "created_at": "2025-09-18T21:47:39", "owner": "ariehnm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967192254958746, "text": "Casio actually make Bluetooth versions of their retro watches. Though they don't have games", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:14:24", "owner": "elyes.bri", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096983518644170, "text": "That’s cool upgrade tbh 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T06:49:44", "owner": "techngneer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896268097297255, "text": "Waawaaweewaah 😍", "created_at": "2025-09-18T09:30:26", "owner": "zubinvev", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17926447556998335, "text": "What the hell i need this", "created_at": "2025-09-18T15:47:33", "owner": "21.355r", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860977084479277, "text": "NFC!!!!!!! the i will buy", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:28:53", "owner": "dr_strange_l0ve", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859850335488554, "text": "Very cool", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:52:04", "owner": "mrsimonweekes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072080756132754, "text": "This is so sick!", "created_at": "2025-09-18T03:40:11", "owner": "brb_photos", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061514981257626, "text": "They are a year out on production time 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T04:39:25", "owner": "aa_ron_jones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085029398026734, "text": "Eu quero", "created_at": "2025-12-15T12:27:33", "owner": "belgicafisio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424113784119447, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:41:24", "owner": "abhis___k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18440147317102828, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:21:40", "owner": "gold_grace1001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064380056535140, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:33:41", "owner": "mr_omkar_rao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085668062107607, "text": "No, just no.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:21:04", "owner": "m_de_mik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049408181430862, "text": "Mom j0v0009", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:08:03", "owner": "sabaly9909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014947655803579, "text": "🤯 👏🏽", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:18:24", "owner": "wearwatchyoulike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293639269286359, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:22:54", "owner": "shiva__reddy___1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092506732926697, "text": "The classic Casio is an antique piece, meant to be a classic, once you start playing games on it, it defeats the aura, it’s now a smart watch. I love it and I own 3. ❤️ 🎄You can check my posts, i guard it jealously with my life. @casionigeria @casio_vintageuk @casiowatches_official", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:44:22", "owner": "vj_moyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100346959762702, "text": "How long does the battery last?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:15:13", "owner": "wilhelmprinceton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064532057565852, "text": "How long does the battery last?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:51:03", "owner": "danielcarranzazarate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072844496345422, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:21:29", "owner": "__thekebin__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107820811715955, "text": "Coooool!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:16:56", "owner": "sr_proper_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921632065054275, "text": "@the_yongester", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:44:04", "owner": "the_yongester", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068427941080294, "text": "Watch name", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:37:16", "owner": "ankush_78jj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865199863437557, "text": "Nice try feds", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:37:46", "owner": "jack.wka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182295139355991, "text": "How do you charge it?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:23:19", "owner": "n.b.m.99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073774232213609, "text": "no wayy 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:13:01", "owner": "hamizansuheil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048360131418207, "text": "قیمت", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:09:23", "owner": "nsab_srrrra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035155301518176, "text": "This is the coolest shit I've seen in a minute", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:12:17", "owner": "_nobodysfaultbutmine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039309566651345, "text": "Sounds a great idea!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:31:40", "owner": "fashionkirk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129506581500994, "text": "Where to order from ?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:06:30", "owner": "traveller_razz", "likes": 0}, {"i