": 18058915856185399, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:21:40", "owner": "protectiongshock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060460718168265, "text": "Cool 👌🏽", "created_at": "2025-10-13T09:56:59", "owner": "meeco_the_cat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025070438560724, "text": "No! I must have it now.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:28:05", "owner": "alexfrigino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068381594209490, "text": "How much is it for", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:07:10", "owner": "abhishekelango", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993193548704906, "text": "Is there one for Casio CA 500?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:01:28", "owner": "vaglovin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054185429642090, "text": "👑", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:55:45", "owner": "renegibran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975711591928629, "text": "All sold out", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:07:37", "owner": "andreypicado4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390963799124184, "text": "Finally!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:14:51", "owner": "flgrm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154355065393044, "text": "Can I use it as a time b@mb ??", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:50:33", "owner": "_lumiviseur_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848538685575541, "text": "Whats the reference of that casio watch?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:51:22", "owner": "kirankommana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094861570702766, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:44:02", "owner": "naseri_watch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325744795209395, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:44:00", "owner": "naseri_watch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056472032224648, "text": "i like how we still call digital watch interiors movements even though they dont move", "created_at": "2025-10-10T02:09:44", "owner": "noyza2132", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072866408226282, "text": "I'd buy it if I can cheat in exams 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T20:53:00", "owner": "tentacie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191195137324899, "text": "Kahzzio", "created_at": "2025-10-09T07:38:52", "owner": "hdusksncbdi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057005879537453, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-09T02:01:22", "owner": "miguelangelmau.50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076154363321541, "text": "So we are restomodding tech now 😝", "created_at": "2025-10-08T19:33:38", "owner": "madsumberohat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413072398114947, "text": "Wow😮", "created_at": "2025-10-08T15:40:23", "owner": "ivanroero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042434687449145, "text": "Notifications", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:25:07", "owner": "silviu.21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071711423241801, "text": "Sold out", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:51:48", "owner": "smspncr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928321894121167, "text": "Soldout😢", "created_at": "2025-10-08T04:51:09", "owner": "bankkomin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078706361009289, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-07T23:21:33", "owner": "sasasocial3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054994313259001, "text": "This is SIIIICK", "created_at": "2025-10-07T15:49:35", "owner": "chrisv_313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159130111348810, "text": "@nicolaiegekvist", "created_at": "2025-10-07T13:40:21", "owner": "mortenreinhart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873759313427670, "text": "Wow. For real ? 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-07T08:19:18", "owner": "pake_jam_tangan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927874978129538, "text": "I have few questions about this chips", "created_at": "2025-10-07T07:27:56", "owner": "afreensayed745", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083394862763787, "text": "What is the ref of this watch?", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:38:43", "owner": "nicolainnielsen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532815877021778, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-06T00:26:47", "owner": "1abamedia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296122390264032, "text": "@o1i.mg", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:30:00", "owner": "roboamigo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923618572118737, "text": "@ethanpretzel22 👀👀👀", "created_at": "2025-10-05T17:06:31", "owner": "thatrudeink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052455533644209, "text": "no thanks ☹️", "created_at": "2025-10-05T13:40:08", "owner": "vanderlyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114740932530526, "text": "Which Casio model is this", "created_at": "2025-10-05T12:25:34", "owner": "dasilva_nathan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089766136877761, "text": "Who ask for this ?", "created_at": "2025-10-04T17:36:21", "owner": "iu_vedant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115296199532853, "text": "Why?", "created_at": "2025-10-04T11:26:03", "owner": "jeremy_slacker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040970504695938, "text": "what type of casio is this?", "created_at": "2025-10-04T04:25:16", "owner": "gebagaskara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424983433096649, "text": "Casio ABL100WE, does the same it's the same watch but less pricer and yes it is officially made by casio, no worries", "created_at": "2025-10-03T14:49:44", "owner": "siddharrth.singh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853013632552040, "text": "Vintage watch❎. Chapri watch✅", "created_at": "2025-10-03T10:24:14", "owner": "the_ripans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129204664476124, "text": "I need this!", "created_at": "2025-10-03T09:30:01", "owner": "__fabiomendes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314662120245516, "text": "This is unbelievably cool. Top marks", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:56:42", "owner": "stevemuaddib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093088381763541, "text": "@_al0wh", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:38:13", "owner": "rezfayazi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318780472243367, "text": "So essentially the Casio ABL100 then. Except for the temperature reading.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:56:34", "owner": "greenstorm_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908782606237189, "text": "Is there a time frame for when it will be back in stock?", "created_at": "2025-10-01T17:37:21", "owner": "shapecloudzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129025660419629, "text": "قیمت", "created_at": "2025-10-01T10:37:09", "owner": "rohola3342kazme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098447527634172, "text": "@mvcmendes esse é pra @biakunze 😅", "created_at": "2025-09-30T22:27:36", "owner": "bmatteelli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869161189448419, "text": "@nabeelnahiyan", "created_at": "2025-09-30T21:09:10", "owner": "fullsendcpr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080353828996386, "text": "Dope!", "created_at": "2025-09-30T06:52:11", "owner": "rockyboy_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082299058777748, "text": "For a second I thought I could mod my 80s Casio, but no 😔", "created_at": "2025-09-30T05:46:22", "owner": "tokriskos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185898268333293, "text": "Sorry, don't need all that technology. I do my step counting with my brain and hand powered abacus that I take everywhere? Sounds dumb? So does transforming your F91W in a smartwatch!", "created_at": "2025-09-30T05:19:59", "owner": "decebalcaliman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843032080581970, "text": "Casio royal 🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-30T01:32:16", "owner": "farmer_farmer_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060923456144371, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-30T01:10:36", "owner": "oprimo.dev", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18023334263738139, "text": "oh hell yeah", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:42:15", "owner": "vilisiltamaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390710263193515, "text": "@k2138dk 😍", "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:57:32", "owner": "thomasdobbeltt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981602712881147, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-09-28T23:19:55", "owner": "eitan_franc0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069859202214650, "text": "FINALLY U CAN PLAY BLACKJACK ON A WATCH.. the implementation is so simple, im surprised it took this long.. i used to play that shit on my calculator 🐥🐥🐥🐥", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:57:38", "owner": "vvvulpster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918490924190430, "text": "May I know can ship to HK?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:38:56", "owner": "all.jai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036258545497438, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-28T12:21:24", "owner": "mark.evan.yadao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308012416221250, "text": "😮🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:42:20", "owner": "___shamiiiiiiiiiim_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081174619812430, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:08:56", "owner": "kpt.mario", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327252268232203, "text": "Where can I buy this??", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:52:56", "owner": "currylamb11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935005351086911, "text": "casio abl 100 👌🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:36:36", "owner": "n_rft1985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981518586872766, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:22:23", "owner": "ro.grytsov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865302907463098, "text": "Where I buy this???", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:39:49", "owner": "kata7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056518445565136, "text": "A watch is meant to be a watch, not tainted", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:49:53", "owner": "sandwich_doctor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947472982044412, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:14:36", "owner": "tolctblx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040857737425225, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-26T23:07:23", "owner": "juda.line", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981612627903259, "text": "Retro Future ! amazing ! will it have any sort of notifications like beeping or flashing lights for calls , messaging etc..in the near future ? Great job !", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:44:27", "owner": "domnu.rey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956620053990532, "text": "Too bad it's not available", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:17:18", "owner": "volkersfreunde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285290932302709, "text": "Still banned on airports right ?😂", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:42:04", "owner": "thebigbookofphotos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523598905059477, "text": "does it work on the F105?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T13:57:31", "owner": "martin.tanubrata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073976954124737, "text": "U have completely missed the point of the watch its ment to be a simple design", "created_at": "2025-09-26T05:38:51", "owner": "stefituk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088743232879170, "text": "I NEED THE AFFILIATE LINK.... NOW..", "created_at": "2025-09-26T02:07:39", "owner": "hm_12703", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114158470523244, "text": "Yes!! Finally.👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T23:48:47", "owner": "mike_lai_creative", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090602722631546, "text": "I see the full watch is sold out ?", "created_at": "2025-09-25T23:42:26", "owner": "arjunghosh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907619401238592, "text": "Where can you buy this Casio watch and can this extra purchased to India ?", "created_at": "2025-09-25T23:40:41", "owner": "arjunghosh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003389555648458, "text": "@theretrofuturephotos", "created_at": "2025-09-25T21:51:09", "owner": "saab_pedz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075874688098550, "text": "Ship worldwide?", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:41:33", "owner": "matheus.augusto91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902035024258746, "text": "uhhh🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:56:06", "owner": "muhakbarhabibi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939468121004351, "text": "@@ticktocktreasures.in you seen this? 🤯", "created_at": "2025-09-25T12:30:05", "owner": "samuraitronvc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110842465490673, "text": "I want this so bad🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-25T11:15:20", "owner": "frgc33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058438088616991, "text": "Dude this is amazing", "created_at": "2025-09-25T05:41:01", "owner": "thebestofasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126163729486612, "text": "Very cool", "created_at": "2025-09-24T15:21:23", "owner": "ericzawo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138388447446804, "text": "MAKE ONE FOR CASIO ROYALE🙏🏿🙏🏿🙏🏿", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:59:12", "owner": "martin_jancarik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084912685729105, "text": "@benswatchclub", "created_at": "2025-09-24T06:19:09", "owner": "haydnbbh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057587165159765, "text": "@dandolahora.cl 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-23T23:04:47", "owner": "juanjomercadal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101370370556004, "text": "Хуета . У меня есть ориджинал электроника 7", "created_at": "2025-09-23T21:43:41", "owner": "serg_madfan39rus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946042474043976, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-23T19:11:53", "owner": "aasehegglanddahl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056654333182426, "text": "How can it monitor the heart if it doesn't have a sensor", "created_at": "2025-09-23T13:55:23", "owner": "wyllgo24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947535244030528, "text": "I can only see the f 91 on the website not this one", "created_at": "2025-09-23T12:53:14", "owner": "nabeel_alsayegh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090523039648321, "text": "This is work of art", "created_at": "2025-09-23T10:50:15", "owner": "nagaraj_nagaram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192052795321933, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-23T07:24:33", "owner": "sbrnastar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078958844071626, "text": "This totally defeats the purpose of a Casio.", "created_at": "2025-09-23T07:19:23", "owner": "kristozondagh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106249129510751, "text": "Fantastic 🤩", "created_at": "2025-09-22T21:07:53", "owner": "mohammad25.f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996997572827625, "text": "Now all I need is a button to locate my phone", "created_at": "2025-09-22T17:11:18", "owner": "marco.esq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038637008467228, "text": "55$ ???", "created_at": "2025-09-22T14:50:33", "owner": "eul.tobi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089195647871526, "text": "Does it work for wheelchair users?", "created_at": "2025-09-22T11:37:56", "owner": "magnus_labrador", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987682287850049, "text": "Eita k  maravilha", "created_at": "2025-09-22T10:24:15", "owner": "silva_mariasocorrogomesda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114887191516871, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-22T09:04:10", "owner": "dirty_industrial_planet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186408859330403, "text": "Powerful piece 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-22T08:29:53", "owner": "darkovibes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012409661790648, "text": "Damn looks pretty sick", "created_at": "2025-09-22T07:27:16", "owner": "dancingboar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917516788179638, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-09-22T06:51:24", "owner": "tjroe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072254408169754, "text": "@ahmed_khan_380", "created_at": "2025-09-22T02:39:01", "owner": "dr.subash.jr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092235079697569, "text": "1329502*4", "created_at": "2025-09-22T02:29:57", "owner": "benjvelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054490490220845, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T21:41:11", "owner": "sukumarpant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923080654120177, "text": "WHAAAAT", "created_at": "2025-09-21T21:04:51", "owner": "juanjoseperez91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141127483421462, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-21T20:00:31", "owner": "rezamirmotalebi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075782219021865, "text": "The new casio also can do this", "created_at": "2025-09-21T16:37:11", "owner": "udoderguru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184475518328337, "text": "Casio ABL-100 have classic look, steptracker, sync, great price and battery life. Other whistles and blows from this custom module do not make sense to me", "created_at": "2025-09-21T12:24:03", "owner": "lifoxes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088329298853720, "text": "@hmdtvkli", "created_at": "2025-09-21T10:50:49", "owner": "hasan22sh6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049840445640036, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-21T08:56:35", "owner": "_nahid._.mir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078129596081849, "text": "this is sooooo smart 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:52:17", "owner": "b666666613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063877400369569, "text": "I want one with electroluminescence", "created_at": "2025-09-21T07:45:47", "owner": "kttyshrks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977425395763958, "text": "Send me one!! I’ll make a high quality product review. My first ever!! I love this!!!!🔥❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-21T02:35:12", "owner": "theofficialyetti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019805303753755, "text": "Can I do contactless card payments with the watch?", "created_at": "2025-09-21T00:33:01", "owner": "stonejoshy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072167569897829, "text": "Front door open", "created_at": "2025-09-20T23:47:43", "owner": "userpercy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058061426144891, "text": "Wow ✨", "created_at": "2025-09-20T20:30:29", "owner": "c7a.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18501761368064250, "text": "Does it have Apple Pay?", "created_at": "2025-09-20T19:56:01", "owner": "oliveroth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065641751032803, "text": "Love that", "created_at": "2025-09-20T19:20:24", "owner": "viljami_walid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959651445843467, "text": "deus é bom de maaaais 👄😲", "created_at": "2025-09-20T19:17:38", "owner": "chryspimenta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065009471205269, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:33:50", "owner": "di_key__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097205854655458, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:05:07", "owner": "arjang.z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968115963955032, "text": "I don’t think there’s enough space for the current model of optical HRM/Blood Oxygen meter in this shell. Most you get is a step counter and something that can chime when your phone gets a message.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:42:09", "owner": "wildcardjack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068764261977627, "text": "F*** yes thanks for showing me this! Ordered two 😍", "created_at": "2025-09-20T16:27:29", "owner": "albinekb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087186835869255, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:03:44", "owner": "90p0inting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944901049022356, "text": "Module, not movement", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:19:51", "owner": "tacodias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017723402780333, "text": "Can it run doom", "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:00:18", "owner": "jayjaymcfry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127201564479310, "text": "Love this, will sleep tracking be possible in the near future?💤🛌", "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:05:33", "owner": "stann_canter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881017462388852, "text": "Can u deliver to Turkey İstanbul?", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:57:37", "owner": "idkwhattochoise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842181871583507, "text": "Price ???", "created_at": "2025-09-20T08:25:29", "owner": "h.dobrudzhaliev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986680686722569, "text": "This is awesome", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:57:49", "owner": "about_reza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923344969148346, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:57:29", "owner": "about_reza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998982519818820, "text": "پولمو بگیر و واسم بفرستتتتتت", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:53:47", "owner": "arsalansaadii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040088228688434, "text": "@muhfernanda ide bagus ini", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:51:02", "owner": "ilhamirawan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869975176437699, "text": "and how often should it be charged then?", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:32:12", "owner": "mihailstacanov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061346141377358, "text": "Thank you very much, Mossad, but we don't fall into it again 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:03:12", "owner": "yoad8iluz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095424112662578, "text": "Take my money", "created_at": "2025-09-20T05:51:03", "owner": "aquabyme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099375565714742, "text": "@justonemorewatch new mod video?", "created_at": "2025-09-20T05:33:51", "owner": "finnatkinson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057825173146587, "text": "wait WHAAAAT", "created_at": "2025-09-20T05:19:32", "owner": "feelapulse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974489484921756, "text": "GOLD!!", "created_at": "2025-09-20T05:04:05", "owner": "aanchalja.in", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411915169114177, "text": "I like that keyboard", "created_at": "2025-09-20T03:50:18", "owner": "ewoltrev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930578277985309, "text": "Will it work on every casio watch??", "created_at": "2025-09-20T03:37:04", "owner": "asad_khan_950", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052239788557978, "text": "Please guide the process?", "created_at": "2025-09-20T03:36:57", "owner": "asad_khan_950", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289811581282297, "text": "It is costly to import in india 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-20T03:32:39", "owner": "thoughts_oxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959860485994912, "text": "this mf called it a cazzio", "created_at": "2025-09-20T02:13:44", "owner": "dmn_bby_y_u_bsing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083486314898528, "text": "So cooooll!!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-20T01:47:05", "owner": "floren.oren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074266582889422, "text": "My F-91 is listening", "created_at": "2025-09-20T01:34:08", "owner": "bpascoa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915246598191681, "text": "But it still not good as pebble", "created_at": "2025-09-20T01:03:38", "owner": "i_am_babushkin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055339889627875, "text": "No way", "created_at": "2025-09-20T00:16:34", "owner": "oakaloko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18502607965069398, "text": "😂why? I don't want to be connected, that's why I have a Casio", "created_at": "2025-09-20T00:12:10", "owner": "ch1n1t4_m3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901689487266628, "text": "Tbh what I need from a smartwatch are notifications.", "created_at": "2025-09-20T00:08:06", "owner": "veramonster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124138042488520, "text": "Kazio", "created_at": "2025-09-19T23:39:24", "owner": "mehiarss1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933641755006842, "text": "@watch_lucas", "created_at": "2025-09-19T22:33:31", "owner": "_yurirsilva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027796241718720, "text": "name of mode?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T21:14:57", "owner": "sad_mafia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132979573456353, "text": "CASIO IS LOSING BIG BUSINESS HERE FOR DECADES NOW.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T19:50:21", "owner": "rafalop.es", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974647743771055, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T19:48:14", "owner": "hosseindehdar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075106031040361, "text": "@casiowatches_official you need to partner up 🔝 this is brilliant", "created_at": "2025-09-19T19:32:56", "owner": "wydraaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359666794087238, "text": "Is ti compatible with the f105w?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T18:56:12", "owner": "pablo.schdr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18509356663067563, "text": "So cool! Wish I had little boy wrists so it didn’t look ridiculous on me.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T18:55:19", "owner": "skaramicke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520463152054218, "text": "@alfredo.dlh qué me decí?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T18:52:57", "owner": "matias.mnag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074244310893530, "text": "😍🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T18:50:03", "owner": "_shardanov_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423586024102059, "text": "Looks a lot like the open source Sensor Watch project, I wonder if there's any connection 🤔", "created_at": "2025-09-19T18:29:54", "owner": "snep.sh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084169063914817, "text": "GPS tracking with Strava sync and I'm sold", "created_at": "2025-09-19T18:22:02", "owner": "whitehawk_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865834375391720, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-19T18:08:43", "owner": "bad_fish60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987332328850219, "text": "But Casio makes this now? They have a version from factory. So why do i need to mod it myself?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T17:57:58", "owner": "andersen_o1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973002687924081, "text": "@karrzzy_", "created_at": "2025-09-19T17:39:57", "owner": "____sevasti____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865735348457197, "text": "This is exactly the oposite of why people are byuying Casios 🙂", "created_at": "2025-09-19T17:30:28", "owner": "brankovicv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032735021507042, "text": "there is new cadio that does that", "created_at": "2025-09-19T17:19:57", "owner": "anasaltarefe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922935922148942, "text": "@casiowatches_official  @casiobrasil", "created_at": "2025-09-19T16:59:56", "owner": "_gcosta_ferro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111740914546539, "text": "Ok I rather have this", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:43:04", "owner": "syidah.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066818420248445, "text": "hart rate with a metal back?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:38:59", "owner": "dhollanderlars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980418321913727, "text": "Changeling", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:29:29", "owner": "zukkca_chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069252965336345, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:12:40", "owner": "maciej.farmaceuta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942709279047818, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-19T14:53:58", "owner": "hossam_elbesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529838914039779, "text": "want to spend less? Buy a Casio ABL 100 WE. You will have the same features only not the heart rate monitor. Check my reels for ABL 100 review and unboxing.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T14:37:28", "owner": "watches_ki_duniya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982497228819548, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T14:07:26", "owner": "cryptorastas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986924586710709, "text": "This Casio isnt about Vibe and looks its the features which you cant beat", "created_at": "2025-09-19T13:57:09", "owner": "justcallneeraj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964364826966729, "text": "Casio watching this 🤦🏻 \"Why didn't I think of this before?\"", "created_at": "2025-09-19T13:46:51", "owner": "r4nieri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081690808937957, "text": "20$ max", "created_at": "2025-09-19T13:03:34", "owner": "halkern747", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915420232190996, "text": "Wow!!", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:52:48", "owner": "rowingthesound", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979602864875564, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:42:51", "owner": "fallen_with_her_curls_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100367563616193, "text": "What the accuracy about HRM useless tech 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:24:58", "owner": "muhendisys1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074049215282505, "text": "@callmeshazzam", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:23:39", "owner": "_.me.is.ace._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075882739850986, "text": "Smells like scam.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:13:37", "owner": "worksbyhbj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924094438137671, "text": "This is Crazy, i love it", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:02:18", "owner": "tommaso.ferri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925281625134613, "text": "Need it india 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:02:06", "owner": "rajivvikas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074837957514511, "text": "@windahbasudara ini bangg, coba di jamnya", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:00:25", "owner": "fanimew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871553311432321, "text": "So nieche and propriety thing. Let's see where this 2 years from now. The watch will outlive this and at least you can remove it. Good luck though", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:59:16", "owner": "pancakespeedy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086476870880346, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:54:51", "owner": "faraz_duostgharin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065071670037229, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:49:02", "owner": "m.shamsipour65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126336229479800, "text": "@charbinkss broooo", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:39:18", "owner": "tilou509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075991747853130, "text": "Onde compro ?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:29:36", "owner": "arthue.a_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861813841473612, "text": "This is like the best thing on tech ever.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:25:03", "owner": "nik_holo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882467470263281, "text": "@the_mad_watch_collector", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:24:46", "owner": "nicholashywel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127210369486027, "text": "How much to Indonesia?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:20:34", "owner": "akbarsoegiharto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075234344026433, "text": "@hein_vdh 🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:19:50", "owner": "evdhrst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851697583502556, "text": "А где можно заказать ?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:04:45", "owner": "kyrbanov.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080453098943065, "text": "Type lain ada gak? 😍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T11:03:51", "owner": "studioasoka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986755209722003, "text": "Gasskeun paman @harry_apriliandi", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:55:13", "owner": "tegami.store", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364330105156444, "text": "This is amazing", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:46:34", "owner": "alexwallace_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911455003198439, "text": "This is genius", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:46:31", "owner": "a.aymanz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355360915090698, "text": "“Movement” 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:40:55", "owner": "barrymquinn2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047516552320360, "text": "@whatknotman 😮", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:39:51", "owner": "bha_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051066044276466, "text": "Do you make one for the AE-1200WH?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:37:22", "owner": "abdullah_gadatia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098947303713826, "text": "Where ? How many ? Plzzzzz", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:31:04", "owner": "metzgermarceau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006550892683700, "text": "Cool !", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:10:30", "owner": "dean_leeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912028798200937, "text": "Does it need an account to function", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:04:52", "owner": "sadxsticl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175924369354259, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:55:24", "owner": "yakoope", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845006383573972, "text": "I love my Casio watch but I am jealous of Apple Watch’s notifications, I had one and it was great that my watch vibrates instead of a phone and to see instantly who is bothering me", "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:25:48", "owner": "stasiekbudek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080427598958495, "text": "This is harddd actually 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:23:31", "owner": "nich.yc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926184685102446, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:17:19", "owner": "thistooshallpassss_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057955457612352, "text": "How can I get it?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:14:30", "owner": "mj.almehairbi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857204812458310, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:14:20", "owner": "bouboutyassine", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038393177474026, "text": "I thought Casio did come up with one. As in ur don’t need to pop anything.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:12:30", "owner": "vellyafonso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110964262547771, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:58:29", "owner": "samqahqaei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529248193036040, "text": "@hmdtvkli", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:35:35", "owner": "arashkarimikurdish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087593527864763, "text": "Finally! The thing I'm hoping to get!", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:35:01", "owner": "jefflow_nature", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028369772735587, "text": "تو ایرانم میاد؟😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:27:18", "owner": "ali.m.b.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056425871179102, "text": "I want this", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:26:42", "owner": "mohammadtaghy_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076105724047176, "text": "Backlit???", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:22:43", "owner": "fajarnarendra_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008562773796590, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:13:10", "owner": "mariashogh_55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074609540037915, "text": "Does it work with A700W?", "created_at": "2025-09-19T08:11:23", "owner": "shunsuke_10969_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401746225143424, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:47:07", "owner": "mr.disnad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855988441519719, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:46:05", "owner": "creatvemnds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946068478042844, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:45:53", "owner": "creatvemnds", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069091619229153, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:36:20", "owner": "jfr_mojtaba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017901371774540, "text": "Holy shit", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:21:52", "owner": "satriakaruniaer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087781615873882, "text": "Que precio tiene donde se vende", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:18:20", "owner": "marianomora01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079276346074946, "text": "Genius.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:13:39", "owner": "salfarlieben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064223171058529, "text": "This work on a G shock tho Vv???", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:12:50", "owner": "kierolovesyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059678123120613, "text": "Need gps tracker for save traveling ways🙌", "