it?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:42:00", "owner": "gavinostertag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854325934536473, "text": "Ist ja nicht so, dass die Uhren mittlerweile eh alle bluetooth haben und so oder so mit dem Handy zu koppeln sind.", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:38:51", "owner": "_geronimmoo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111304477479186, "text": "لینک دانلود لطفا 😔💔", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:36:31", "owner": "_thepoker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021713825754924, "text": "That is exactly why I wear a Casio watch", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:34:35", "owner": "landauermich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100186576616517, "text": "Bullshit", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:30:21", "owner": "alimovic.fares", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074275291887074, "text": "Waaaaaat Epic", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:19:48", "owner": "marisalex666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016298624787494, "text": "Just needs Google Assistant technology and it's golden!", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:15:08", "owner": "bicyclecellar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057747209414113, "text": "Price?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:04:56", "owner": "andystant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907711426231380, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:04:43", "owner": "_rezabehroozi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058607036617061, "text": "And turns battary life from 7 years to 7 days.", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:04:05", "owner": "amir_h3zarkhani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526697455060026, "text": "Damn 🔥😍", "created_at": "2025-09-18T19:56:13", "owner": "nihal_thekkath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898341655279127, "text": "TAKE MY MONEY JUST TAKE IT", "created_at": "2025-09-18T19:51:29", "owner": "amine_bouassida_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082799239928375, "text": "Can it show me the answers in the test?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T19:42:18", "owner": "micha_lba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058911314124159, "text": "Step tracker. What are you doing bro", "created_at": "2025-09-18T19:38:30", "owner": "lansonsghost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983025465736655, "text": 