wner": "mohammadshonn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055508696188571, "text": "Please tell me I can control music too and get notifications", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:29:26", "owner": "x.crucify_me.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854425207536418, "text": "still your old Casio with some useless addons, no thanks.", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:14:42", "owner": "ozi3501", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938326714067627, "text": "I have an origional casio with Bluetooth amd step counts", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:11:42", "owner": "duncan.s.shaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531618010035002, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:11:39", "owner": "oldyankeewatches", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311841757173441, "text": "Cool 😍", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:07:34", "owner": "ansar_techy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932863429095693, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:07:34", "owner": "tony_paltoglou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041465930418985, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:03:23", "owner": "ca30ioo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857623816510900, "text": "✨️", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:59:04", "owner": "ft.kunal222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862912627411311, "text": "🖤", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:53:32", "owner": "invisible_me09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077212703074089, "text": "@hmdtvkli", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:45:36", "owner": "mehranhabibnezhad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883102162379999, "text": "You send to EU?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:45:10", "owner": "zgonu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053664047222898, "text": "Need this", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:43:47", "owner": "daydreamers__co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076732972845190, "text": "I'll definitely get this on my casio", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:37:53", "owner": "nessuno0__0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863731993405483, "text": "Casio: nice idea, here's our lawyer letter.", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:35:20", "owner": "johndiew0107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916783585177849, "text": "Would that work with the Casio calculator watch.....", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:31:35", "owner": "wthbuddymuddydogofchaos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941404329931110, "text": "Das gibt es doch von Casio selber auch. 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:30:57", "owner": "rubenschmalenberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055894691394486, "text": "Yeah no, I'll be living in a cave with my F-91W.", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:25:26", "owner": "galenpengra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970546791947118, "text": "Wonderfull idea🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:11:00", "owner": "gragz_sound", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044168408354110, "text": "Isn't there already a \"smart watch\" Casio?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:03:20", "owner": "troeten_timo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070896257177164, "text": "thisbis so good", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:02:43", "owner": "dr.sulubeyin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905565748248956, "text": "@dandolahora.cl QUEE", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:55:07", "owner": "jpvalenzuela.ca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130283617462420, "text": "CaZio", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:47:17", "owner": "adventurescalendar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965869188876845, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:47:17", "owner": "oguzcan.gider", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865679956453535, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:41:41", "owner": "rifqirizqullaah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879753229279788, "text": "Ual!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:41:10", "owner": "criscamposbsb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092737357752713, "text": "That's so cool, need to get me one of these for my Casio's 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:20:33", "owner": "andrewbarneschannel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844657558574847, "text": "It's all I wanted", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:20:32", "owner": "farnaz.poor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519832255009684, "text": "🙌 WoW 🤩", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:19:54", "owner": "stay_h1gh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867733633378702, "text": "@olleewatch Come si ricarica?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:19:41", "owner": "gabrielechiarella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074538850893779, "text": "This a need not a want", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:18:24", "owner": "b.mohapi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053801168219942, "text": "🗣️ \"heart rate monitoring\"", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:17:43", "owner": "rinogodson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988253658844938, "text": "wait, this is op for school", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:16:14", "owner": "jkingbikes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041893724401626, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:10:19", "owner": "annu.rajeev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304757629220598, "text": "just bought a diy kit!", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:08:40", "owner": "lannibal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037045238487122, "text": "how much does it all cost?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:04:34", "owner": "calin296452", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068852768520127, "text": "@hokaz", "created_at": "2025-09-18T16:00:13", "owner": "bistohf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154406299378843, "text": "And how do you charge that? 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-18T15:56:56", "owner": "2712.pedrx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099980794717387, "text": "SO COOOOL 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T15:52:43", "owner": "arch.17.94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923563588016025, "text": "Do you have a option for the a168?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T15:25:38", "owner": "jimmy_pena_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935401423077396, "text": "Does it replace the display?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T15:23:24", "owner": "ali.blacksquare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103231381613370, "text": "Huuum, that fire I guess!", "created_at": "2025-09-18T15:23:10", "owner": "hamid_frvr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071060180273398, "text": "Do you think this would fit in my Seiko H461 watch?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T15:09:25", "owner": "emul32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077890097073227, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:46:13", "owner": "eliaslazaro_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865824157452459, "text": "Ghis is not practical at all", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:28:33", "owner": "iliabakhtrionski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870507100437098, "text": "خیلی ایده ی خوبیه", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:28:01", "owner": "novin_karimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202686400309758, "text": "Is it possible to change the battery on this board?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:25:18", "owner": "ruangb._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057058928576155, "text": "How is measure your heart rate? There is no sensor under the watch.", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:21:23", "owner": "_dr.pashaei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978913461876627, "text": "Awesome!", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:20:52", "owner": "miguelmargmz17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340165837206739, "text": "Yo. More tech like this please!!", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:05:43", "owner": "dylanmacintosh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091124935763913, "text": "omg 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:42:28", "owner": "sekopisme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120861853503036, "text": "Nice, pushing buttons a hundred times and stupid button combos just like in the old days!", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:39:40", "owner": "stojpodx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013421171790255, "text": "Top", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:37:40", "owner": "williamcorreiagarcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013784189785950, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:32:38", "owner": "sheikhtatveeltayyab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879084667287085, "text": "Cazzio ?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:24:38", "owner": "heywood_yabuzzoff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096666652650672, "text": "damn", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:21:52", "owner": "aniruddhav1806", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098846029651010, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:14:54", "owner": "_zaringhalam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845128333571342, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T13:07:34", "owner": "bsvkhv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086751835855690, "text": "That's amazing", "created_at": "2025-09-18T12:49:24", "owner": "vegan_feet_uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101210329613445, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T12:41: