 WiFi module", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:32:47", "owner": "shreytalreja25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921210841119973, "text": "Oldschool never dies!)))", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:32:09", "owner": "airyfizz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098538550729430, "text": "can we add a backlight too on it", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:30:02", "owner": "krv_picx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079154471495157, "text": "So cool😍❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:23:40", "owner": "vroom.vroom.vargaheg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116964511511834, "text": "What model?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:19:59", "owner": "apmitp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920907634141448, "text": "Hacker hai bhai hacker", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:18:49", "owner": "sooumya.rr.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049924748307133, "text": "Casio makes these that conect to there app and track steps to", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:16:38", "owner": "graysoncelio123456", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089249074809082, "text": "@chronograph_2022  what is this 😮", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:12:25", "owner": "_aj_stranger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016127579785060, "text": "Take my moneyyyy", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:10:04", "owner": "kovvu.king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085428379932856, "text": "Great gadget but the price is too high", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:03:49", "owner": "hugonkkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096829387648834, "text": "There is the new Casio ABL 100we with Bluetooth functions", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:49:05", "owner": "lxu.agxs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075561677079447, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:44:40", "owner": "__estero__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083829310907703, "text": "Ni99er", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:42:59", "owner": "sinein.othf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972304374934031, "text": "Play doom", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:40:27", "owner": "kalleb.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071242046165960, "text": "Oooo!!!! I want it", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:18:18", "owner": "webpage4204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060264539600261, "text": "Do you have plans for any G shocks?", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:16:38", "owner": "nerfherder_79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933117634089398, "text": "@_nilann_", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:11:55", "owner": "_nalinkarthik_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167628583363864, "text": "Unbelievably creative 🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:09:23", "owner": "friendkeeper_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044603861363244, "text": "Holy shit this is so cool", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:09:06", "owner": "_somebadstuff_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061644470080968, "text": "That is the point, don't make everything smart, otherwise it makes us Dumer...", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:07:05", "owner": "the.pale.blue.d0t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096473701651811, "text": "🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T10:05:39", "owner": "_rudrapatel._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107789794560383, "text": "WOW!!😍🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-18T09:59:22", "owner": "funkysetiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071114206942252, "text": "THIS, this is the reason I love tech", "created_at": "2025-09-18T09:28:40", "owner": "suavehere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291759292267976, "text": "I want buy", "created_at": "2025-09-18T09:26:52", "owner": "bulanlanie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089827399833750, "text": "@plewarissa @omdathetwillis", "created_at": "2025-09-18T08:44:30", "owner": "johangroot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945352510022222, "text": "I love this.. amazing", "created_at": "2025-09-18T07:10:34", "owner": "sho0k_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063676451346880, "text": "Qué genio", "created_at": "2025-09-18T06:35:38", "owner": "_ideb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100469458718052, "text": "This remind me of @kronaby", "created_at": "2025-09-18T06:11:58", "owner": "z2sebastian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069458411334212, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-18T05:46:25", "owner": "dev_sm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020527418766077, "text": "Pp", "created_at": "2025-09-18T05:38:28", "owner": "ashish38jirs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 180